    "Supplied meshes retain original low polygon geometry; commercial redistribution rights not independently established",
    "Painted raster1774x887 with separate5400px measured detail; UHD rendering does not make the painted bitmap native4K",
    "Local campaigns now resume from a validated atomic save. Network credentials and room state are excluded; remembered account sessions remain unfinished.",
